sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Recipe as Recipe
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Recipe: publishVersion()
    Note over Recipe: Policies: recipeRead, recipeWrite, recipeExecute
    Note over Recipe: Guards (4)
    Recipe->>Recipe: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;draft#quot;
    Recipe->>Recipe: guard[1]: self.draftedAt != null
    Recipe->>Recipe: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    Recipe->>Recipe: guard[3]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;kitchenManageAccess#quot;)
    Recipe->>Recipe: mutate.status
    Recipe->>Recipe: mutate.publishedAt
    Recipe->>EventBus: emit RecipeVersionPublished on recipe.version_published
    Recipe-->>-Client: void